  "metadata": {
    "job": "V-carve inlay coaster",
    "revision": "A",
    "notes": "One operation cuts BOTH halves: the female pocket in this board and the male plug from a second board of the same thickness. glueGap sinks the male's V so the flanks seat before the apex, sawAllowance is the stock you plane off afterwards, and the O's counter has to survive as standing material on the male."
  },
